## Title: Snipers Friend
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 0.7.0
## APIVersion: 101049 101050
## Description: Reticle dot, a 3D aim line capped at your ground ability's range (e.g. Elemental Explosion 28m, keep/siege buffs included) that is cut off by walls so you can see where your aim lands, range/LOS tinting, and unlocked camera sensitivity, height and distance. Settings via the Add-Ons menu (LibHarvensAddonSettings) or /sf.
## SavedVariables: SnipersFriendSavedVars
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings
## DevId: 18d399f0-14ef-40a3-8f08-1aaa8cd0a5de

